<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1679] Invalid thrift implementation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1679</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1613&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1613&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Added the ability to access spark ui.&lt;br/&gt;
However, this implementation&apos;s thift protocol seems to have arbitrarily modified the code that is automatically generated.&lt;br/&gt;
Therefore, zeppelin is not built if you generate the code automatically by calling generate_thift.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13021393">ZEPPELIN-1679</key>
            <summary>Invalid thrift implementation</summary>
