		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Todos&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;x&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; add event META_INFOS in RemoteInterpreterService.thrift&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;x&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; import generate code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is the Jira issue?&lt;br/&gt;
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1679&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1679&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;How should this be tested?&lt;br/&gt;
    1. First you need to install thift 0.9.2.&lt;br/&gt;
    2. Run zeppelin-interpreter / src / main / thrift / generate_thrift.sh.&lt;br/&gt;
    3. Build full zeppelin.&lt;br/&gt;
    4. After build, please check the interpreter spark setting in our web ui.&lt;br/&gt;
    5. Try using the spark ui button.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    If everything is running normally, it is a success.&lt;br/&gt;
    Problems occur in the current master 3.&lt;/p&gt;

